    <description>ShortGeek turns an article, a feed or a one line topic into a finished vertical short on
your own machine. It drafts the script from the source rather than inventing content.

* Takes an article of your own, an RSS feed, an article URL, or a one line topic
* Narrates with a free neural voice and burns in captions timed word by word
* Renders 1080x1920 MP4, ready to upload to TikTok, Reels or YouTube Shorts
* Backgrounds are the source article's own screenshots, animations drawn in code, or your clips
* No AI generated imagery, no account, no watermark, no export limit

Free to download and use. Python and ffmpeg are inside the installer, so there is nothing to
install first.</description>
    <summary>Free vertical short video maker for Windows, narrated and captioned, on your own machine</summary>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/techygeekshome/ShortGeek/releases/tag/v1.0.2</releaseNotes>
